# Firm rules for agents and contributors

This file belongs to your firm. The generator wrote it once and will never
overwrite it. `AGENTS.md` (generated) tells every agent to read it.

Add conventions that are specific to your practice, for example:

- naming standards for families, views, sheets, or materials;
- which Revit versions and project templates you support;
- review expectations for tools that write to models;
- deployment channels and who approves a release.

Keep rules short and testable. If a rule conflicts with `AGENTS.md`, say so
explicitly here so agents know which one wins.
